Ziy Shields — third-party data licenses
======================================

Ziy Shields is a blocking engine, and the data it blocks with is public filter
lists. Those lists are DATA, in the same way a dictionary is data: Ziy reads
them, compiles them into rules, and ships the compiled result. Ziy's own code —
the parser, the compiler, the precedence resolver, the UI — is written for Ziy
and contains nothing copied from any other product.

The lists below are redistributed with their licenses and attributions intact.
The list BODIES are bundled verbatim (they are the data); the attribution and
licence notices travel with them.


